Generated: {{ $json.generatedAt }}

All open PRs ({{ $json.allOpen.length }}):
{{ $json.allOpen.map(p => `#${p.number} "${p.title}" by @${p.author} — ${p.ageDays}d old, ${p.changedFiles} files changed (+${p.additions}/-${p.deletions}), reviewers: ${p.reviewers.length ? p.reviewers.join(', ') : 'NONE'}, labels: ${p.labels.join(', ') || 'none'}`).join('\n') }}

Stale PRs (3+ days no activity): {{ $json.stalePRs.length }}
{{ $json.stalePRs.map(p => `#${p.number}`).join(', ') || 'none' }}

